# Verification Requirements

## Chrome MCP Server Checks
Use Chrome MCP server to check:

- Route loads without errors.
- Console/network logs are clean.
- Screenshots/diffs vs legacy (spacing/layout may differ, structure must match).
- Axe a11y passes with no serious violations.
- Feature flags behave correctly ON/OFF (check `util/auth/feature-flags.ts` patterns).
- Analytics events fire correctly (check `util/tracking/constants.ts` naming).

## Manual Verification Fallback
If MCP is unavailable, attach manual screenshots + console/network logs.
